{"status":"OperationalNoVerdict","record":{"source_kind":"PIZ2","context_version":2,"revision":2,"record_id":"f1ac1e61eeafddf83a198c8d14170662ca54645946c9e3167a7902b7b3cbcc78","previous_record":"8dbdfd57ce4e0f1ecab511f4df2a672260c54de8fc9a873f8d152b95d0539ded","state_digest":"8d576e6c18a7c2ef1855d013be95033b757a17165f7b36213edd5c5a64859ddb","identity_key":"559469c4e71ca1020da12bdc208ca01fcb0fa883066e24b04e74a550df667bf8","operation_id":"poc002-c2","case_id":"lgc-824d5388a12f26103c78cac6f16283ad64f17609d489d1415f51d86648676c33","scope":"WORK→NURA","obligation":"ASHT exact positive-negative distinction","origin_i0":"Evaluate Earth rotation angle under the declared mathematical model only.","actual_user_text":"The Earth rotation angle must be checked under the same declared model. I do not yet supply a numerical claim or a measured observation.","actual_light_i0":"The Earth rotation angle must be checked under the same declared model. I do not yet supply a numerical claim or a measured observation.","parent_question_sha256":"8e82e74cce0a15e38d5a981e28bbd08ff8fa1aeb89dad80f275f8dc493687f04","answer_spans":[],"question":"Operational_iZ — Rasti lgc-824d5388a12f26103c78cac6f16283ad64f17609d489d1415f51d86648676c33 ruan pyetjen fillestare «Evaluate Earth rotation angle under the declared mathematical model only.» dhe detyrimin ASHT exact positive-negative distinction. Në hyrjen reale të tanishme «The Earth rotation angle must be checked under the same declared model. I do not yet supply a numerical claim or a measured observation.», tentativa T3_30ce9bb738f442eb_P00000fe0_18e35cab38f0cbd4 nuk gjeti të dy kandidatët pozitiv dhe negativ të pranuar saktësisht për Xi/Yi e saj. Për të ngushtuar detyrimin e provës, jep materialin pozitiv mbështetës; materialin negativ kundërshtues; dallimin konkret midis Xi dhe Yi; burimin e kontrollueshëm; kushtin ose provën që do ta rrëzonte dallimin. Nëse nuk e ke këtë material, thuaje; mungesa nuk plotësohet automatikisht. Referencat e mbledhura ruajnë vetëm material USER_REPORTED për të njëjtin detyrim; prania e tekstit nuk provon relevancë ose vërtetësi dhe nuk plotëson vetë Xi/Yi. Kjo pyetje kërkon provën që mungon; nuk parashikon përgjigjen e ardhshme dhe nuk është i₀ i përdoruesit. HOLD vijon; NoVerdict.","question_sha256":"c372ee4522f43471d780cb8fd7ad8b03fe06e91b3cf39a487f4824e7c93aa6cd","missing":"Both","hold":true,"status":"OperationalNoVerdict","authority_transferred":false,"knowledge_verdict":null,"knowledge_write":0,"session_turn_count":2,"session_started_at":1793378966380,"session_last_activity_at":1793378968086,"mapped_parent":true,"native_anchor":null,"checkpoint_base":null,"native_attempt":"T3_30ce9bb738f442eb_P00000fe0_18e35cab38f0cbd4","hold_id":"h-3460bd5190edccc59ca934fc11087bd2","requested_fields":["Positive","Negative","Distinction","SourceReference","Verification"],"supplied_fields":[],"frontier":[],"events":[{"kind":"Origin","sequence":0,"authority":0,"attempt":"T3_30ce9bb738f442eb_P00000fe0_18e35cab38f0cbd4","digest":"2b091fd87d693bc045510547a02983146b0ac6d4dccb9d26b9bd50249aa1c33f"},{"kind":"Precondition","sequence":1,"authority":0,"attempt":"T3_30ce9bb738f442eb_P00000fe0_18e35cab38f0cbd4","digest":"3642dac416980962d86a86b13481a4dcc53fd655900f46f839785e25f2a6f607"},{"kind":"ActionActivation","sequence":2,"authority":0,"attempt":"T3_30ce9bb738f442eb_P00000fe0_18e35cab38f0cbd4","digest":"b76fe79cd471063d24a0f611febd5f3a23e52cae8a1168e7767f4e407c71e4a4"},{"kind":"Outcome","sequence":3,"authority":0,"attempt":"T3_30ce9bb738f442eb_P00000fe0_18e35cab38f0cbd4","digest":"059be04aa0849c55ba9e8c72a8a72d4105cabbcf3bb6719df4b796fd171ae3f4"},{"kind":"AssemblyActivation","sequence":4,"authority":0,"attempt":"T3_30ce9bb738f442eb_P00000fe0_18e35cab38f0cbd4","digest":"76ca7554efb546da0dc5a68339a239a86b16908e1cc581c6b54f5f999026ca65"},{"kind":"Assembly","sequence":5,"authority":0,"attempt":"T3_30ce9bb738f442eb_P00000fe0_18e35cab38f0cbd4","digest":"47029635c197d22ffd1ca0dd3e73997ad2b7a0e92da4b4c79d